  <section class="product-rail" aria-labelledby="products-title"><header><h2 id="products-title">Small tools. Ready to use.</h2><p>No LLM wrapper and no unnecessary workflow. Everything is assembled locally in your browser from maintained rules.</p></header><div><article><span>01 / MAIN PRODUCT</span><h3>SEO Skill Packs</h3><p>Eight professional SEO methods, packaged for your agent.</p><a href="/en/skill-packs">Open packs →</a></article><article><span>02 / QUICK START</span><h3>Skill Generator</h3><p>Three inputs for one general, evidence-led SEO Agent Skill.</p><a href="/en/seo-agent-skill">Create skill →</a></article><article><span>03 / SAFETY</span><h3>Policy Generator</h3><p>Define scope, write permissions, data access, cost, and stop rules.</p><a href="/en/seo-agent-policy-generator">Generate policy →</a></article><article><span>04 / QUALITY</span><h3>Skill Check</h3><p>Review third-party or edited skills locally against twelve explicit rules.</p><a href="/en/seo-agent-skill-check">Check a skill →</a></article></div></section>
  <section class="home-section skill-home-steps" aria-labelledby="simple-title"><header class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="simple-title">It should be this simple.</h2><p>The generator personalizes one strong SEO-agent skill. It does not assemble an arbitrary stack of modules.</p></div></header><ol><li><span>01</span><h3>Choose a task</h3><p>Technical SEO, keywords, internal links, or content opportunities.</p></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Add the website</h3><p>Add an optional short focus. Nothing else is required.</p></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Use the skill</h3><p>Copy it as a prompt or download <code>SKILL.md</code>.</p></li></ol></section>
